    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur in the most part of the island after 1.00 p.m. Heavy falls above 100 mm are likely at some places in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central, Uva, North-Western and Southern provinces and in Anuradhapura district.",
